[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [ ] [38;5;153mAssignee[39m
  [38;5;246mOne person responsible. The strongest relevance signal for notifications; I'd take this one above all others.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Comments / discussion
  [38;5;246mA sub-entity, not a field. Dominant source of notification volume in real task apps, and roughly doubles sub-project [39m
  [38;5;246mone.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Due date
  [38;5;246mCheap plain field. Adds a 'due date changed' event, and later enables deadline-based reminders.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Priority / labels
  [38;5;246mCheap plain fields for triage and filtering. Adds low-value change events unless people filter on them.[39m
  [38;5;246m5. [39m[ ] [38;5;246mType something[39m
